<title>JAPAN: Japan end-Apr pork stocks down 14.1% - industry body.</title>
<headline>Japan end-Apr pork stocks down 14.1% - industry body.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's pork stocks as of the end of April were 130,885 tonnes, down 14.1 percent from a year earlier, the Agriculture and Livestock Industries Corp said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The breakdown is as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Month	Apr 97     Mar 97     Apr 96     Apr 97/Apr 96</p>
<p> Total	130,885    135,441    152,413     -14.1 pct</p>
<p> Domestic    20,095     17,490     11,856     +69.5 pct</p>
<p> Imported   110,790    117,951    140,557     -21.2 pct</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
</text>
